<div id="albums" data-albums="{albums htmlAttrJson, fields='title, released', rows=3}"></div>

<p>The attribute as the page holds it:</p>
<pre><code>{albums htmlAttrJson, fields='title, released', rows=3}</code></pre>

<p>One row - htmlAttrJson='record':</p>
<pre><code>{albums htmlAttrJson='record', fields='title, price', $album_id=7}</code></pre>
